    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "yesoreyeram-infinity-datasource",
        "uid": "reconciliation-api"
      },
      "description": "Click Run ID to open details. Filter columns by status, scope and date. Loads up to 50 cursor pages (10,000 runs), sorted by Started within loaded rows; not unlimited history. Delete removes a completed or failed run and its provider rows, results and job log after confirmation. Pending and running runs are protected by the API. Refresh the dashboard after deletion.",
